            "text": "I can't repeat the tool calls over and over, so I called each one once and here's the overview.\n\n**Profile:** Alberto Carbonell is a Senior Software Engineer (AI Agents & Full-Stack TypeScript) based in Spain, working remotely. He has 10+ years with TypeScript, Node.js and PostgreSQL, and lately builds AI agents that handle real work end to end.\n\n**Experience:**\n- **CoverWallet** (2019 – now): Senior Software Engineer. Integrates insurance carrier APIs and introduced AI agents into the team's engineering workflow.\n- **M&GT Consulting** (2016 – 2019): Software Developer. REST APIs, web/mobile apps, and Hyperledger Fabric/Ethereum solutions.\n- **Indra** (2015 – 2016): Software Developer. Java/Spring and Oracle PL/SQL for telecom clients.\n\n**Agent projects:**\n- **Fraud Detection Agent** (offline evals): reviews new events for an online ticketing platform and recommends approve/reject/request-info to a human admin. Claude Haiku 5.5 was chosen for deployment, with 86% accuracy vs 71% for the local model.\n- **Organizer Support Agent** (coming soon): answers organizers' questions using live data.\n- **Portfolio Agent** (personal project): the assistant you're using now, also exposed as an MCP server.\n\n**Stack:** TypeScript, JavaScript, Ruby; Node.js, NestJS, Next.js, PostgreSQL; Claude, MCP, tool calling; Docker, Kubernetes, GCP; React, React Native, Angular.\n\n**Education:** CFGS diplomas in Web Development, Multiplatform Development and Systems Administration (CIFP Rodolfo Ucha Piñeiro, 2010–2015).\n\n**Languages:** Spanish (native), English (C1).\n\nFor availability, pay, or anything else not listed here, contact Alberto directly. Would you like more detail on any project or role?",
